{"status":"ok","message-type":"work","message-version":"1.0.0","message":{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,8,14]],"date-time":"2026-08-14T18:50:07Z","timestamp":1786733407990,"version":"build-2736575974"},"reference-count":99,"publisher":"AIP Publishing","issue":"8","license":[{"start":{"date-parts":[[2024,2,22]],"date-time":"2024-02-22T00:00:00Z","timestamp":1708560000000},"content-version":"vor","delay-in-days":0,"URL":"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/licenses\/by\/4.0\/"},{"start":{"date-parts":[[2024,2,22]],"date-time":"2024-02-22T00:00:00Z","timestamp":1708560000000},"content-version":"tdm","delay-in-days":0,"URL":"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/licenses\/by\/4.0\/"}],"funder":[{"DOI":"10.13039\/501100001809","name":"National Natural Science Foundation of China","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","award":["Grant No. U20A20301"],"award-info":[{"award-number":["Grant No. U20A20301"]}],"id":[{"id":"10.13039\/501100001809","id-type":"DOI","asserted-by":"publisher"}]},{"DOI":"10.13039\/501100001809","name":"National Natural Science Foundation of China","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","award":["52327809"],"award-info":[{"award-number":["52327809"]}],"id":[{"id":"10.13039\/501100001809","id-type":"DOI","asserted-by":"publisher"}]},{"DOI":"10.13039\/501100001809","name":"National Natural Science Foundation of China","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","award":["52250273"],"award-info":[{"award-number":["52250273"]}],"id":[{"id":"10.13039\/501100001809","id-type":"DOI","asserted-by":"publisher"}]},{"DOI":"10.13039\/501100001809","name":"National Natural Science Foundation of China","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","award":["51825601"],"award-info":[{"award-number":["51825601"]}],"id":[{"id":"10.13039\/501100001809","id-type":"DOI","asserted-by":"publisher"}]}],"content-domain":{"domain":["pubs.aip.org"],"crossmark-restriction":true},"short-container-title":[],"published-print":{"date-parts":[[2024,2,28]]},"abstract":"<jats:p>Thermal transport in wurtzite aluminum nitride (w-AlN) significantly affects the performance and reliability of corresponding electronic devices, particularly when lattice strains inevitably impact the thermal properties of w-AlN in practical applications. To accurately model the thermal properties of w-AlN with high efficiency, we develop a machine learning interatomic potential based on the atomic cluster expansion (ACE) framework. The predictive power of the ACE potential against density functional theory (DFT) is demonstrated across a broad range of properties of w-AlN, including ground-state lattice parameters, specific heat capacity, coefficients of thermal expansion, bulk modulus, and harmonic phonon dispersions. Validation of lattice thermal conductivity is further carried out by comparing the ACE-predicted values to the DFT calculations and experiments, exhibiting the overall capability of our ACE potential in sufficiently describing anharmonic phonon interactions. As a practical application, we perform a lattice dynamics analysis using the potential to unravel the effects of biaxial strains on thermal conductivity and phonon properties of w-AlN, which is identified as a significant tuning factor for near-junction thermal design of w-AlN-based electronics.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.1063\/5.0188905","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2024,2,22]],"date-time":"2024-02-22T12:59:06Z","timestamp":1708606746000},"update-policy":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1063\/aip-crossmark-policy-page","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":15,"title":["Machine-learned atomic cluster expansion potentials for fast and quantum-accurate thermal simulations of wurtzite AlN"],"prefix":"10.1063","volume":"135","author":[{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-8941-5450","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Guang","family":"Yang","sequence":"first","affiliation":[{"name":"Key Laboratory for Thermal Science and Power Engineering of Ministry of Education, Department of Engineering Mechanics, Tsinghua University 1 , Beijing 100084, China"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-5948-7031","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Yuan-Bin","family":"Liu","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Inorganic Chemistry Laboratory, Department of Chemistry, University of Oxford 2 , Oxford OX1 3QR, United Kingdom"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0003-3250-138X","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Lei","family":"Yang","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Key Laboratory for Thermal Science and Power Engineering of Ministry of Education, Department of Engineering Mechanics, Tsinghua University 1 , Beijing 100084, China"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0003-3588-972X","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Bing-Yang","family":"Cao","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Key Laboratory for Thermal Science and Power Engineering of Ministry of Education, Department of Engineering Mechanics, Tsinghua University 1 , Beijing 100084, China"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"317","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2024,2,22]]},"reference":[{"key":"2024031414561038500_c1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"070501","DOI":"10.1063\/5.0156691","article-title":"Prospectives for AlN electronics and optoelectronics and the important role of alternative synthesis","volume":"123","year":"2023","journal-title":"Appl. Phys. Lett."},{"key":"2024031414561038500_c2","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"185105","DOI":"10.1063\/1.5097172","article-title":"Thermal conductivity of crystalline AlN and the influence of atomic-scale defects","volume":"126","year":"2019","journal-title":"J. Appl. Phys."},{"key":"2024031414561038500_c3","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"100397","DOI":"10.1016\/j.pquantelec.2022.100397","article-title":"Recent advances in optoelectronic and microelectronic devices based on ultrawide-bandgap semiconductors","volume":"83","year":"2022","journal-title":"Prog. Quant. Electron."},{"key":"2024031414561038500_c4","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","first-page":"27","DOI":"10.1007\/978-3-319-24100-5","volume-title":"III-Nitride Ultraviolet Emitters Technology and Applications","author":"Kneissl","year":"2016"},{"key":"2024031414561038500_c5","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"658","DOI":"10.1016\/j.sna.2006.03.001","article-title":"Piezoelectric properties of polycrystalline AlN thin films for MEMS application","volume":"132","year":"2006","journal-title":"Sens. Actuators Phys."},{"key":"2024031414561038500_c6","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"185107","DOI":"10.1063\/1.5028141","article-title":"The influence of point defects on the thermal conductivity of AlN crystals","volume":"123","year":"2018","journal-title":"J. Appl. Phys."},{"key":"2024031414561038500_c7","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"124878","DOI":"10.1016\/j.ijheatmasstransfer.2023.124878","article-title":"Three-sensor 2\u03c9 method with multi-directional layout: A general methodology for measuring thermal conductivity of solid materials","volume":"219","year":"2024","journal-title":"Int. J. Heat Mass Transfer"},{"key":"2024031414561038500_c8","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"4020","DOI":"10.1016\/j.jcrysgro.2008.06.032","article-title":"Large-area AlN substrates for electronic applications: An industrial perspective","volume":"310","year":"2008","journal-title":"J. Cryst. Growth"},{"key":"2024031414561038500_c9","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"1852","DOI":"10.1039\/D0TC04182C","article-title":"Ultrawide-bandgap semiconductor AlN crystals: Growth and applications","volume":"9","year":"2021","journal-title":"J. Mater. Chem. C"},{"key":"2024031414561038500_c10","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"77","DOI":"10.1038\/nphoton.2007.293","article-title":"Ultraviolet light-emitting diodes based on group three nitrides","vo